{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SNgzgLCm3j1794358135.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>領展宣布以近2.4億新加坡元、折合約14.6億港元，向英康保險收購新加坡東福坊百分之50.1權益。</p><p></p><p>交易預計明年首季完成，屆時英康保險將繼續持有東福坊百分之49.9權益。</p><p></p><p>東福坊是一項位於新加坡東部近郊的零售物業，可出租面積約21.4萬平方呎。雙方計劃分階段開展資產提升項目，料明年展開工程。領展認為，收購符合聚焦亞太區零售資產的策略，有助推動資產組合多元化及業務增長。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.904218+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T00:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:56:28.205136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T01:43:38.338386+00:00","content_hash":"d97fb3e5c3b5cc90000c44db2435dd51b46501875d7a4e2f0468c79246fc08cd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T01:50:13.904218+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}